      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Gathered in the Claude Monet dining room, Victoria and the restaurant staff approach Max to apologize for ruining his birthday celebration. Chef Viktor steps in to ensure peace is restored, bringing the long day of intense conflicts to an end. Let's listen to their conversation in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Максим, прости нас, пожалуйста.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Мы испортили тебе отличный праздник.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я не сержусь на вас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Прости их, пожалуйста, от души.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ну и меня тоже прости.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Так, всё? Конфликт закончился?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Да, шеф, конфликт закончился.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Но только пока кто-то снова не ошибётся.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Мы все хотим мира на кухне.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Мир на кухне — это главное.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Спасибо всем за добрые слова.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Теперь мы можем спокойно работать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я очень рад, что мы помирились.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's examine this reconciliation line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Максим, прости нас, пожалуйста.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Maxim, please forgive us.' Vika starts with a sincere plea for forgiveness.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Мы испортили тебе отличный праздник.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We ruined a great holiday for you.' She admits fault, acknowledging the damage done to the occasion.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я не сержусь на вас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am not angry at you.' Max responds generously, letting go of any resentment.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Прости их, пожалуйста, от души.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please forgive them from the heart.' Vika urges him to extend that same grace to the others.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ну и меня тоже прости.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well and forgive me too.' Barinov chimes in, casually asking to be included in the pardon.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Так, всё? Конфликт закончился?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So, is that all? The conflict is over?' He then asks for confirmation that the drama is officially resolved.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Да, шеф, конфликт закончился.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, chef, the conflict is over.' Max agrees respectfully, putting the issue to rest.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Но только пока кто-то снова не ошибётся.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'But only until someone makes a mistake again.' Barinov adds a cynical caveat, warning that peace is fragile.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Мы все хотим мира на кухне.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We all want peace in the kitchen.' Vika expresses a collective desire for a harmonious work environment.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Мир на кухне — это главное.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Peace in the kitchen is key.' Barinov reinforces this, stating it as a fundamental requirement.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Спасибо всем за добрые слова.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you all for the kind words.' Max shows appreciation for their willingness to make amends.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Теперь мы можем спокойно работать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now we can work calmly.' Vika looks forward to resuming normal operations without the tension.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я очень рад, что мы помирились.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
