      "t": "Relieved that the tension has dissipated, Max accepts their apologies as Victoria and Chef Viktor return to their work in the restaurant. Next time you watch the episode, listen for the Russian expressions for 'to forgive' and 'to spoil' — you will catch every word right away. See you next time!",
